{"clase": "<h4>Podas y orden de exploración</h4>\n<ul><li>Aquí exploramos primero la rama ≤ y en profundidad. El óptimo no depende del orden; la cantidad de nodos sí.</li>\n<li><b>Cota con coeficientes enteros</b>: si los c<sub>j</sub> son enteros, el Z entero es entero, así que un nodo con Z = 25,5 puede dar como máximo 25. Si la incumbente ya tiene 25, ese nodo se poda.</li>\n<li>Un nodo hijo nunca tiene Z mayor que su padre.</li>\n<li><b>Gap</b> = Z(RL) − Z(entero): lo que se \"pierde\" por exigir enteros.</li></ul>", "ejemplos": [{"q": "<p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = x<sub>1</sub> + x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;6x<sub>1</sub> − 6x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 9<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub> + 6x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 18<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0, enteros</div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Resuelva la relajación lineal mediante el método gráfico.</li><li><b>b)</b> Resuelva el problema entero mediante Branch and Bound (muestre el árbol).</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Relajación lineal (método gráfico)</h5><p>Se grafican las restricciones como igualdades, se sombrea la región factible y se evalúa Z en cada vértice:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 300\" class=\"graph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Región factible\"><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"34.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"89.2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"89.2\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"89.2\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"144.5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"144.5\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"144.5\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"199.7\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"199.7\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"199.7\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"255.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"255.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"255.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"310.2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"310.2\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"310.2\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"210.8\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"210.8\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"214.8\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"155.5\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"155.5\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"159.5\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"100.3\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"100.3\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"104.3\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"45.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"45.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"49.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266\" class=\"axl\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"12\" class=\"axl\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"260\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">x₁</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"20\" class=\"ax\">x₂</text><polygon points=\"34.0,266.0 116.9,266.0 247.1,135.8 34.0,100.3\" class=\"reg\"/><line x1=\"116.9\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"328.0\" y2=\"54.9\" class=\"cl c0\"/><text x=\"146.2\" y=\"236.7\" class=\"clab c0\">(1)</text><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"100.3\" x2=\"328.0\" y2=\"149.3\" class=\"cl c1\"/><text x=\"126.2\" y=\"111.0\" class=\"clab c1\">(2)</text><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"210.8\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"155.5\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"100.3\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"89.2\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"89.2\" cy=\"210.8\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"89.2\" cy=\"155.5\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"144.5\" cy=\"210.8\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"144.5\" cy=\"155.5\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"199.7\" cy=\"155.5\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"116.9\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"100.3\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"247.1\" cy=\"135.8\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"247.1\" cy=\"135.8\" r=\"6\" class=\"opt\"/><text x=\"255.1\" y=\"127.8\" class=\"olab\">RL (27/7; 33/14)</text><rect x=\"194.7\" y=\"150.5\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"iopt\"/><text x=\"207.7\" y=\"169.5\" class=\"ilab\">entera (3; 2)</text></svg><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Vértice (x₁; x₂)</th><th>Z</th><th>Z (decimal)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>(0; 0)</th><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>(0; 3)</th><td>3</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>(3/2; 0)</th><td>3/2</td><td>1,5</td></tr><tr><th>(27/7; 33/14)</th><td>87/14</td><td>6,214</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Óptimo de la RL: x<sub>1</sub> = 27/7 ≈ 3,857, x<sub>2</sub> = 33/14 ≈ 2,357, Z = 87/14 ≈ <b>6,214</b>. Es una <b>cota superior</b> para el problema entero.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Branch and Bound</h5><p>Se ramifica la primera variable fraccionaria (x<sub>1</sub> antes que x<sub>2</sub>), explorando primero la rama ≤. Cada nodo se resuelve gráficamente agregando su restricción.</p><div class=\"tree\"><ul><li><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P0</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 3,857<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2,357<br>Z = 6,214<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≤ 3</div><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P1</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 3<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2,5<br>Z = 5,5<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 2</div><div class=\"node inc\"><div class=\"nl\">P11</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 3<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 2<br>Z = 5<div class=\"tg\">Entera → incumbente</div></div></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 3</div><div class=\"node ent\"><div class=\"nl\">P12</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 0<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 3<br>Z = 3<div class=\"tg\">Entera (no mejora)</div><div class=\"nn\">entera pero no mejora a la incumbente</div></div></li></ul></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≥ 4</div><div class=\"node nf\"><div class=\"nl\">P2</div><b>Infactible</b><div class=\"tg\">Poda: infactible</div></div></li></ul></li></ul></div><p><b>Óptimo entero:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 3, x<sub>2</sub> = 2, Z = <b>5</b> (nodo P11). Gap = 6,214 − 5 = 1,214.</p></div>", "intro": "Problema 1 del C2 2023-1."}], "ejercicios": [{"q": "<p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 2x<sub>1</sub> + 7x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;6x<sub>1</sub> + 7x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 9<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;2x<sub>1</sub> + x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 27<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0, enteros</div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Resuelva la relajación lineal mediante el método gráfico.</li><li><b>b)</b> Resuelva el problema entero mediante Branch and Bound (muestre el árbol).</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Relajación lineal (método gráfico)</h5><p>Se grafican las restricciones como igualdades, se sombrea la región factible y se evalúa Z en cada vértice:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 300\" class=\"graph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Región factible\"><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"34.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"118.7\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"118.7\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"118.7\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"203.3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"203.3\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"203.3\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"288.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"288.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"288.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"181.3\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"181.3\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"185.3\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"96.7\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"96.7\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"100.7\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"12.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"12.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"16.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266\" class=\"axl\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"12\" class=\"axl\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"260\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">x₁</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"20\" class=\"ax\">x₂</text><polygon points=\"34.0,266.0 161.0,266.0 34.0,157.1\" class=\"reg\"/><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"157.1\" x2=\"161.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"cl c0\"/><text x=\"53.2\" y=\"166.2\" class=\"clab c0\">(1)</text><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"181.3\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"118.7\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"157.1\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"161.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"157.1\" r=\"6\" class=\"opt\"/><text x=\"42.0\" y=\"149.1\" class=\"olab\">RL (0; 9/7)</text><rect x=\"29.0\" y=\"176.3\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"iopt\"/><text x=\"42.0\" y=\"195.3\" class=\"ilab\">entera (0; 1)</text></svg><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Vértice (x₁; x₂)</th><th>Z</th><th>Z (decimal)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>(0; 0)</th><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>(0; 9/7)</th><td>9</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><th>(3/2; 0)</th><td>3</td><td>3</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Óptimo de la RL: x<sub>1</sub> = 0 ≈ 0, x<sub>2</sub> = 9/7 ≈ 1,286, Z = 9 ≈ <b>9</b>. Es una <b>cota superior</b> para el problema entero.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Branch and Bound</h5><p>Se ramifica la primera variable fraccionaria (x<sub>1</sub> antes que x<sub>2</sub>), explorando primero la rama ≤. Cada nodo se resuelve gráficamente agregando su restricción.</p><div class=\"tree\"><ul><li><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P0</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 0<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 1,286<br>Z = 9<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 1</div><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P1</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 0,333<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 1<br>Z = 7,667<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≤ 0</div><div class=\"node inc\"><div class=\"nl\">P11</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 0<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 1<br>Z = 7<div class=\"tg\">Entera → incumbente</div></div></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≥ 1</div><div class=\"node pod\"><div class=\"nl\">P12</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 1<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 0,429<br>Z = 5<div class=\"tg\">Poda por cota</div><div class=\"nn\">Z = 5 ≤ incumbente 7</div></div></li></ul></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 2</div><div class=\"node nf\"><div class=\"nl\">P2</div><b>Infactible</b><div class=\"tg\">Poda: infactible</div></div></li></ul></li></ul></div><p><b>Óptimo entero:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 0, x<sub>2</sub> = 1, Z = <b>7</b> (nodo P11). Gap = 9 − 7 = 2.</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 4x<sub>1</sub> + 4x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;4x<sub>1</sub> + 9x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 33<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3x<sub>1</sub> + 5x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 10<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0, enteros</div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Resuelva la relajación lineal mediante el método gráfico.</li><li><b>b)</b> Resuelva el problema entero mediante Branch and Bound (muestre el árbol).</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Relajación lineal (método gráfico)</h5><p>Se grafican las restricciones como igualdades, se sombrea la región factible y se evalúa Z en cada vértice:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 300\" class=\"graph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Región factible\"><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"34.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"97.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"97.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"97.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" 