\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"244.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"6\" class=\"opt\"/><text x=\"252.0\" y=\"258.0\" class=\"olab\">RL (10/3; 0)</text><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"261.0\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"iopt\"/><text x=\"231.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ilab\">entera (3; 0)</text></svg><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Vértice (x₁; x₂)</th><th>Z</th><th>Z (decimal)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>(0; 0)</th><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>(0; 2)</th><td>8</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><th>(10/3; 0)</th><td>40/3</td><td>13,333</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Óptimo de la RL: x<sub>1</sub> = 10/3 ≈ 3,333, x<sub>2</sub> = 0 ≈ 0, Z = 40/3 ≈ <b>13,333</b>. Es una <b>cota superior</b> para el problema entero.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Branch and Bound</h5><p>Se ramifica la primera variable fraccionaria (x<sub>1</sub> antes que x<sub>2</sub>), explorando primero la rama ≤. Cada nodo se resuelve gráficamente agregando su restricción.</p><div class=\"tree\"><ul><li><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P0</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 3,333<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 0<br>Z = 13,333<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≤ 3</div><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P1</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 3<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 0,2<br>Z = 12,8<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 0</div><div class=\"node inc\"><div class=\"nl\">P11</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 3<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 0<br>Z = 12<div class=\"tg\">Entera → incumbente</div></div></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 1</div><div class=\"node pod\"><div class=\"nl\">P12</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 1,667<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 1<br>Z = 10,667<div class=\"tg\">Poda por cota</div><div class=\"nn\">Z = 10,667 ≤ incumbente 12</div></div></li></ul></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≥ 4</div><div class=\"node nf\"><div class=\"nl\">P2</div><b>Infactible</b><div class=\"tg\">Poda: infactible</div></div></li></ul></li></ul></div><p><b>Óptimo entero:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 3, x<sub>2</sub> = 0, Z = <b>12</b> (nodo P11). Gap = 13,333 − 12 = 1,333.</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = x<sub>1</sub> + 3x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;7x<sub>1</sub> + x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 22<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;8x<sub>1</sub> + 5x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 41<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0, enteros</div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Resuelva la relajación lineal mediante el método gráfico.</li><li><b>b)</b> Resuelva el problema entero mediante Branch and Bound (muestre el árbol).</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Relajación lineal (método gráfico)</h5><p>Se grafican las restricciones como igualdades, se sombrea la región factible y se evalúa Z en cada vértice:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 300\" class=\"graph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Región factible\"><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"34.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"57.6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"57.6\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"57.6\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"81.3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"81.3\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"81.3\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"104.9\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"104.9\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"104.9\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"128.5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"128.5\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"128.5\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"242.4\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"242.4\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"246.4\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"218.7\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"218.7\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"222.7\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"195.1\" x2=\